<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>Who is it for? <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.who_is_it_for != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.who_is_it_for | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p><span>Anyone with hairfall &amp; damaged hair<br> Anyone who needs to restore hair thickness<br> Someone with brittle hair that breaks easily<br> Anyone searching for a natural hair conditioner</span></p>{% endif %}</div></details>
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>Ingredients <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.ingredients != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.ingredients | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p><span>Distilled Aloe Vera Water, Distilled Rosemary water, Aloe Vera, Grape Seed Oil, Virgin Coconut Oil, Daruharidra, Rosemary Oil, Moringa Oil, Flaxseed Oil, Rosemary Leaves, Marshmellow oil, Mixed fruits extract, Clarysage infused oil, Peppermint infused oil, Geranium essential oil, Cedarwood essential oil, Jasmine infused oil, Tea tree infused oil, Amla, Cetyl Alcohol, Staryl Alcohol, BTMS 50, Vegetable Glycerin, Shea butter, Vitamin E, Stearic acid, Behentrimonium chloride, Cetrimonium chloride, Propylene glycol, Polyquaternium-7, Polyquaternium-10, Hydrolysed Collagen, Hydrolysed keratin, Vitamin B5, Aloevera gel, Niacinamide, Hydrolised wheat protein, Lactic acid, Natural betaine</span></p>{% endif %}</div></details>
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>What is it? <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.what_is_it != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.what_is_it | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p><span>This conditioner infuses the best herb for hair growth &amp; repair- Rosemary, into a buttery smooth conditioner. It is great to repair damaged &amp; really dry hair, that can be caused due to a Vata Dosha imbalance. It is a hair repair treatment that is made with fresh rosemary water!</span></p>{% endif %}</div></details>
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>What makes it different <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.why_it_is_unique != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.why_it_is_unique | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p><span>This product is very unique because it can give you salon smooth hair at home. It shows results within the first use and repairs damaged hair while promoting hair growth. We distill the rosemary leaves at our facility and infuse this rosemary water in the conditioner.</span></p>{% endif %}</div></details>
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>Disclaimer <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.disclaimer != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.disclaimer | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p>A patch test is mandatory. If the product or a natural ingredient irritates your skin, please stop using it immediately. Please consult your naturopath or physician before using these products.</p>{% endif %}</div></details>
